+@dataclass
+class PinRequest:
+    """Pin the CPU radix path matching token_ids against eviction.
+
+    Victim-pinning (ThunderAgent L2 design): sent by the TA router when it
+    pauses a program so the write-behind CPU copy survives until resume.
+    Fire-and-forget (no response), like PutRequest.
